<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>转一圈，末端画出什么？</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFE0F5' }}>M2 · 驱动问题</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 372, background: '#0E3F8C', padding: 28, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8FB6E8', letterSpacing: 3 }}>驱动问题</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 27, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>只知道“一根连杆多长、转了多少度”，怎么算出它末端的坐标？</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', padding: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>要把它变成一行代码：</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CFE0F5', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>polar_to_xy(L, theta)</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 42, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>先猜再验：长 0.3 m 的连杆，你猜它末端在哪？</Text>
            </Box>
            <Table
                style={{ width: '100%', height: 236 }}
                defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 16, textAlign: 'center', color: '#1A2230' }}
                defaultCellStyle={{ border: { left: { width: 1, color: '#E8EFF8' }, right: { width: 1, color: '#E8EFF8' }, top: { width: 1, color: '#E8EFF8' }, bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E8EFF8' } } }}
                cells={[
                    [
                        { text: '转过的角度 θ', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                        { text: '0°', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                        { text: '90°', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                        { text: '180°', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                        { text: '270°', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } }
                    ],
                    [
                        { text: '我猜末端的 (x, y)', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
                        { text: '？', textStyle: { color: '#1E4FA8', bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
                        { text: '？', textStyle: { color: '#1E4FA8', bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
                        { text: '？', textStyle: { color: '#1E4FA8', bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
                        { text: '？', textStyle: { color: '#1E4FA8', bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } }
                    ],
                    ['跑完代码后的真值', '？', '？', '？', '？'],
                    ['误差 / 差异原因', '', '', '', '']
                ]}
            />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>判断：轨迹是“圆”不是巧合</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>圆的方程本身就是 sin / cos —— 记住这句话，它就是整门课的世界观起点。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 44, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.5 }}>第 2 章 · M2　单位圆与“角度坐标”</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>09 / 21</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
